We provide financial information feed through FTP and API. Data feed consists of Stock Market data, Equity, Derivatives, IPOs Commodities, Currency, Mutual Funds, Corporate Announcements, News, Other Markets, Company Information - Historical, Real-time and End of the Day.
ACE Wealth Manager is a web based multi asset back office solution with Transaction, Revenue Management. MIS and Client Portfolio. It is best suited for Mutual Fund Distributor. IFA, Stock Brokers and Wealth Managers. It can also be extended to Branch, Employee (RM) and Sub-broker/ Franchisees.
We design innovative websites along with financial content for financial domain. Our data and research management capabilities provide enhanced data aggregation. indexing. searching and distribution that meet your information needs, thereby increasing operational efficiency.
ACE Report is customized desktop-based application for preparing investment/portfolio review reports in ‘.xls’ or '.ppt’ format. It is customized /delivered as project as per client’s requirement. Accord Fintech has developed such projects for leading advisory/wealth management firms who manages portfolio.
ACETP is a Windows desktop-based application for comparing company financial information of Indian business entities for transfer pricing.
A Web Based Online Transaction platform for Mutual Fund for Purchase, Redemption, SIP, SWP, STP Of Mutual Fund Schemes powered By BSE / NSE / MFU Platform. Major step in MF Online / Robo Advisory Platform.